-Except for a) above, the percentages of ownership for determining who must provide a guaranty will be based on the post-sale percentage of ownership in the business.
-For ESOP transactions, there is a statutory requirement that if the seller of the employer small business remains as a partial owner, the seller must provide a full, unlimited guarantee regardless of ownership – this
